2026-07-27T15:03:18.5294438Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T15:03:18.5295338Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T15:03:18.5296358Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
